',"," '","低","风险","'],\\n","   "," ['","9","',"," '","塞","上","阳光","测试","公司","',"," '","非","危","化","行业","',"," '","未","投产","',"," '","0","',"," '","低","风险","'],\\n","   "," ['","10","',"," '","天津","弘","羊","生物","工程技术","有限公司","',"," '","非","危","化","行业","',"," '","未","投产","',"," '","0","',"," '","未","评估","'],\\n","],"," widths","=[","1",".","2",","," ","5",","," ","2",".","6",","," ","2",","," ","1",".","6",","," ","2","])\\n\\n","#"," ---------","-"," ","附","注"," ---------","-\\n","doc",".add","_","paragraph","()\\n","add","_","heading","('","数据","说明","与","口径","备注","',"," ","1",")\\n","notes"," ="," [\\n","   "," '","1","."," ","企业","列表","接口","未","按"," page","No"," ","返回","第"," ","2"," ","页","（","两次","请求","结果","一致","），","故","仅","展示","返回","的前"," ","10"," ","条","，","其余"," ","6"," ","家","企业","名称","未","获取","到","。","',\\n","   "," '","2","."," 「","重大","危险","源"," /"," ","重点","监管","工艺"," /"," ","重点","监管","危","化","品","」","企业","列表"," ","3"," ","个","接口","因","缺少"," type"," ","参数","返回","失败","（","500","），","仅","成功","返回","统计","数字","。","',\\n","   "," '","3","."," ","企业","员工","总数","存在","两个","口径","：","企业发展","统计"," ","66"," ","人","，","入驻","企业","状态","统计"," ","101"," ","人","，","原","系统","数据","即","不一致","。","',\\n","   "," '","4","."," ","16"," ","家","入驻","企业中","仅"," ","6"," ","家","填报","生产","状态","为","「","正常","生产","」，","其余","企业","状态","字段","多为","空","，","为","系统","原始","数据","情况","。","',\\n","   "," '","5","."," ","所有","数值","均","来源于","园区","大","屏","「","园区","总","览","」","模块","接口","返回","的","原始"," JSON"," ","字段","，","未","做","加工","推算","。","',\\n","]\\n","for"," n"," in"," notes",":\\n","   "," p"," ="," doc",".add","_","paragraph","()\\n","   "," p",".","paragraph","_format",".","space","_","after"," ="," Pt","(","2",")\\n","   "," run"," ="," p",".add","_run","(n",")\\n","   "," set","_c","n","_f","ont","(r","un",","," '","微软","雅","黑","',"," ","9",","," color","=(","0","x","59",","," ","0","x","59",","," ","0","x","59","))\\n\\n","out"," ="," r","'","D",":\\\\","wind","oc","\\\\","des","ktop","\\\\","3","\\\\","园区","总","览","报告","_","化工","园区","1",".docx","'\\n","doc",".save","(out",")\\n","print","('","s","aved",":',"," out",")\\n","\"","}"]},{"type":"chunk","time":1788943434783,"chunk":{"type":"block-end","index":0,"block":{"type":"reasoning","text":"python-docx 1.2.0 is installed. Now let me create a Word document with the park overview data.\n\nLet me write a Python script that generates a well-formatted Word document containing the 园区总览 data.\n\nContent structure:\n1. Title: 化工园区1 园区总览报告\n2. 一、园区主体信息 (table)\n3. 二、入驻企业与产业发展\n4. 三、两重点一重大\n5. 四、安全管理\n6. 五、园区经济\n7. 六、人员与创新\n8. 七、入驻企业清单\n\nLet me include Chinese font settings (宋体/微软雅黑). In python-docx, need to set East Asian font via rFonts w:eastAsia.\n\nLet me write the script to the workspace and run it.\n\nWorking directory: D:\\windoc\\desktop\\3\n\nI'll write the script file then run it."}}},{"type":"chunk","time":1788943434784,"chunk":{"type":"block-end","index":1,"block":{"type":"text","text":"python-docx 已安装。现在编写生成脚本并导出 Word 文档。"}}},{"type":"chunk","time":1788943434784,"chunk":{"type":"block-end","index":2,"block":{"type":"tool-call","id":"call_00_ANj7pYxc935S4aOrd4jn3058","name":"write","arguments":"{\"file_path\": \"D:\\\\windoc\\\\desktop\\\\3\\\\export_park_overview.py\", \"content\": \"# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-\\n\\\"\\\"\\\"导出「化工园区1 园区总览」Word 文档\\\"\\\"\\\"\\nfrom docx import Document\\nfrom docx.shared import Pt, Cm, RGBColor\\nfrom docx.enum.text import WD_ALIGN_PARAGRAPH\\nfrom docx.enum.table import WD_TABLE_ALIGNMENT\\nfrom docx.oxml.ns import qn\\nfrom docx.oxml import OxmlElement\\n\\ndoc = Document()\\n\\n# ---------- 全局默认字体 ----------\\nstyle = doc.styles['Normal']\\nstyle.font.name = '微软雅黑'\\nstyle.font.size = Pt(10.5)\\nstyle._element.rPr.rFonts.set(qn('w:eastAsia'), '微软雅黑')\\n\\n\\ndef set_cn_font(run, name='微软雅黑', size=10.5, bold=False, color=None):\\n    run.font.name = name\\n    run.font.size = Pt(size)\\n    run.font.bold = bold\\n    run._element.rPr.rFonts.set(qn('w:eastAsia'), nam