{"type":"tool/result","seq":76,"time":1788943554874,"data":{"turn":3,"step":2,"message":{"source":{"kind":"tool","callId":"call_00_Ppf5M0QS9EQWzsv47qh25301"},"content":[{"type":"tool-result","toolCallId":"call_00_Ppf5M0QS9EQWzsv47qh25301","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<path>C:\\Users\\xiaowenbo\\.agents\\skills\\pptx\\pptxgenjs.md</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: # PptxGenJS Tutorial\n2: \n3: ## Setup & Basic Structure\n4: \n5: ```javascript\n6: const pptxgen = require(\"pptxgenjs\");\n7: \n8: let pres = new pptxgen();\n9: pres.layout = 'LAYOUT_16x9';  // or 'LAYOUT_16x10', 'LAYOUT_4x3', 'LAYOUT_WIDE'\n10: pres.author = 'Your Name';\n11: pres.title = 'Presentation Title';\n12: \n13: let slide = pres.addSlide();\n14: slide.addText(\"Hello World!\", { x: 0.5, y: 0.5, fontSize: 36, color: \"363636\" });\n15: \n16: pres.writeFile({ fileName: \"Presentation.pptx\" });\n17: ```\n18: \n19: ## Layout Dimensions\n20: \n21: Slide dimensions (coordinates in inches):\n22: - `LAYOUT_16x9`: 10\" × 5.625\" (default)\n23: - `LAYOUT_16x10`: 10\" × 6.25\"\n24: - `LAYOUT_4x3`: 10\" × 7.5\"\n25: - `LAYOUT_WIDE`: 13.3\" × 7.5\"\n26: \n27: ---\n28: \n29: ## Text & Formatting\n30: \n31: ```javascript\n32: // Basic text\n33: slide.addText(\"Simple Text\", {\n34:   x: 1, y: 1, w: 8, h: 2, fontSize: 24, fontFace: \"Arial\",\n35:   color: \"363636\", bold: true, align: \"center\", valign: \"middle\"\n36: });\n37: \n38: // Character spacing (use charSpacing, not letterSpacing which is silently ignored)\n39: slide.addText(\"SPACED TEXT\", { x: 1, y: 1, w: 8, h: 1, charSpacing: 6 });\n40: \n41: // Rich text arrays\n42: slide.addText([\n43:   { text: \"Bold \", options: { bold: true } },\n44:   { text: \"Italic \", options: { italic: true } }\n45: ], { x: 1, y: 3, w: 8, h: 1 });\n46: \n47: // Multi-line text (requires breakLine: true)\n48: slide.addText([\n49:   { text: \"Line 1\", options: { breakLine: true } },\n50:   { text: \"Line 2\", options: { breakLine: true } },\n51:   { text: \"Line 3\" }  // Last item doesn't need breakLine\n52: ], { x: 0.5, y: 0.5, w: 8, h: 2 });\n53: \n54: // Text box margin (internal padding)\n55: slide.addText(\"Title\", {\n56:   x: 0.5, y: 0.3, w: 9, h: 0.6,\n57:   margin: 0  // Use 0 when aligning text with other elements like shapes or icons\n58: });\n59: ```\n60: \n61: **Tip:** Text boxes have internal margin by default. Set `margin: 0` when you need text to align precisely with shapes, lines, or icons at the same x-position.\n62: \n63: ---\n64: \n65: ## Lists & Bullets\n66: \n67: ```javascript\n68: // ✅ CORRECT: Multiple bullets\n69: slide.addText([\n70:   { text: \"First item\", options: { bullet: true, breakLine: true } },\n71:   { text: \"Second item\", options: { bullet: true, breakLine: true } },\n72:   { text: \"Third item\", options: { bullet: true } }\n73: ], { x: 0.5, y: 0.5, w: 8, h: 3 });\n74: \n75: // ❌ WRONG: Never use unicode bullets\n76: slide.addText(\"• First item\", { ... });  // Creates double bullets\n77: \n78: // Sub-items and numbered lists\n79: { text: \"Sub-item\", options: { bullet: true, indentLevel: 1 } }\n80: { text: \"First\", options: { bullet: { type: \"number\" }, breakLine: true } }\n81: ```\n82: \n83: ---\n84: \n85: ## Shapes\n86: \n87: ```javascript\n88: slide.addShape(pres.shapes.RECTANGLE, {\n89:   x: 0.5, y: 0.8, w: 1.5, h: 3.0,\n90:   fill: { color: \"FF0000\" }, line: { color: \"000000\", width: 2 }\n91: });\n92: \n93: slide.addShape(pres.shapes.OVAL, { x: 4, y: 1, w: 2, h: 2, fill: { color: \"0000FF\" } });\n94: \n95: slide.addShape(pres.shapes.LINE, {\n96:   x: 1, y: 3, w: 5, h: 0, line: { color: \"FF0000\", width: 3, dashType: \"dash\" }\n97: });\n98: \n99: // With transparency\n100: slide.addShape(pres.shapes.RECTANGLE, {\n101:   x: 1, y: 1, w: 3, h: 2,\n102:   fill: { color: \"0088CC\", transparency: 50 }\n103: });\n104: \n105: // Rounded rectangle (rectRadius only works with ROUNDED_RECTANGLE, not RECTANGLE)\n106: // ⚠️ Don't pair with rectangular accent overlays — they won't cover rounded corners. Use RECTANGLE instead.\n107: slide.addShape(pres.shapes.ROUNDED_RECTANGLE, {\n108:   x: 1, y: 1, w: 3, h: 2,\n109:   fill: { color: \"FFFFFF\" }, rectRadius: 0.1\n110: });\n111: \n112: // With shadow\n113: slide.addShape(pres.shapes.RECTANGLE, {\n114:   x: 1, y: 1, w: 3, h: 2,\n115:   fill: { color: \"FFFFFF\" },\n116:   shadow: { type: \"outer\", color: \"000000\", blur: 6, offset: 2, angle: 135, opacity: 0.15 }\n117: });\n118: ```\n119: \n120: Shadow options:\n121: \n122: | Property | Type | Range | Notes |\n123: |----------|------|-------|-------|\n124: | `type` | string | `\"outer\"`, `\"inner\"` | |\n125: | `color` | string | 6-char hex (e.g. `\"000000\"`) | No `#` prefix, no 8-char hex — see Common Pitfalls |\n126: | `blur` | number | 0-100 pt | |\n127: | `offset` | number | 0-200 pt | **Must be non-negative** — negative values corrupt the file |\n128: | `angle` | number | 0-359 degrees | Direction the shadow falls (135 = bottom-right, 270 = upward) |\n129: | `opacity` | number | 0.0-1.0 | Use this for transparency, never encode in color string |\n130: \n131: To cast a shadow upward (e.g. on a footer bar), use `angle: 270` with a positive offset — do **not** use a negative offset.\n132: \n133: **Note**: Gradient fills are not natively supported. Use a gradient image as a background instead.\n134: \n135: ---\n136: \n137: ## Images\n138: \n139: ### Image Sources\n140: \n141: ```javascript\n142: // From file path\n143: slide.addImage({ path: \"images/chart.png\", x: 1, y: 1, w: 5, h: 3 });\n144: \n145: // From URL\n146: slide.addImage({ path: \"https://example.com/image.jpg\", x: 1, y: 1, w: 5, h: 3 });\n147: \n148: // From base64 (faster, no file I/O)\n149: slide.addImage({ data: \"image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgo...\", x: 1, y: 1, w: 5, h: 3 });\n150: ```\n151: \n152: ### Image Options\n153: \n154: ```javascript\n155: slide.addImage({\n156:   path: \"image.png\",\n157:   x: 1, y: 1, w: 5, h: 3,\n158:   rotate: 45,              // 0-359 degrees\n159:   rounding: true,          // Circular crop\n160:   transparency: 50,        // 0-100\n161:   flipH: true,             // Horizontal flip\n162:   flipV: false,            // Vertical flip\n163:   altText: \"Description\",  // Accessibility\n164:   hyperlink: { url: \"https://example.com\" }\n165: });\n166: ```\n167: \n168: ### Image Sizing Modes\n169: \n170: ```javascript\n171: // Contain - fit inside, preserve ratio\n172: { sizing: { type: 'contain', w: 4, h: 3 } }\n173: \n174: // Cover - fill area, preserve ratio (may crop)\n175: { sizing: { type: 'cover', w: 4, h: 3 } }\n176: \n177: // Crop - cut specific portion\n178: { sizing: { type: 'crop', x: 0.5, y: 0.5, w: 2, h: 2 } }\n179: ```\n180: \n181: ### Calculate Dimensions (preserve aspect ratio)\n182: \n183: ```javascript\n184: const origWidth = 1978, origHeight = 923, maxHeight = 3.0;\n185: const calcWidth = maxHeight * (origWidth / origHeight);\n186: const centerX = (10 - calcWidth) / 2;\n187: \n188: slide.addImage({ path: \"image.png\", x: centerX, y: 1.2, w: calcWidth, h: maxHeight });\n189: ```\n190: \n191: ### Supported Formats\n192: \n193: - **Standard**: PNG, JPG, GIF (animated GIFs work in Microsoft 365)\n194: - **SVG**: Works in modern PowerPoint/Microsoft 365\n195: \n196: ---\n197: \n198: ## Icons\n199: \n200: Use react-icons to generate SVG icons, then rasterize to PNG for universal compatibility.\n201: \n202: ### Setup\n203: \n204: ```javascript\n205: const React = require(\"react\");\n206: const ReactDOMServer = require(\"react-dom/server\");\n207: const sharp = require(\"sharp\");\n208: const { FaCheckCircle, FaChartLine } = require(\"react-icons/fa\");\n209: \n210: function renderIconSvg(IconComponent, color = \"#000000\", size = 256) {\n211:   return ReactDOMServer.renderToStaticMarkup(\n212:     React.createElement(IconComponent, { color, size: String(size) })\n213:   );\n214: }\n215: \n216: async function iconToBase64Png(IconComponent, color, size = 256) {\n217:   const svg = renderIconSvg(IconComponent, color, size);\n218:   const pngBuffer = await sharp(Buffer.from(svg)).png().toBuffer();\n219:   return \"image/png;base64,\" + pngBuffer.toString(\"base64\");\n220: }\n221: ```\n222: \n223: ### Add Icon to Slide\n224: \n225: ```javascript\n226: const iconData = await iconToBase64Png(FaCheckCircle, \"#4472C4\", 256);\n227: \n228: slide.addImage({\n229:   data: iconData,\n230:   x: 1, y: 1, w: 0.5, h: 0.5  // Size in inches\n231: });\n232: ```\n233: \n234: **Note**: Use size 256 or higher for crisp icons. The size parameter controls the rasterization resolution, not the display size on the slide (which is set by `w` and `h` in inches).\n235: \n236: ### Icon Libraries\n237: \n238: Install: `npm install -g react-icons react react-dom sharp`\n239: \n240: Popular icon sets in react-icons:\n241: - `react-icons/fa` - Font Awesome\n242: - `react-icons/md` - Material Design\n243: - `react-icons/hi` - Heroicons\n244: - `react-icons/bi` - Bootstrap Icons\n245: \n246: ---\n247: \n248: ## Slide Backgrounds\n249: \n250: ```javascript\n251: // Solid color\n252: slide.background = { color: \"F1F1F1\" };\n253: \n254: // Color with transparency\n255: slide.background = { color: \"FF3399\", transparency: 50 };\n256: \n257: // Image from URL\n258: slide.background = { path: \"https://example.com/bg.jpg\" };\n259: \n260: // Image from base64\n261: slide.background = { data: \"image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgo...\" };\n262: ```\n263: \n264: ---\n265: \n266: ## Tables\n267: \n268: ```javascript\n269: slide.addTable([\n270:   [\"Header 1\", \"Header 2\"],\n271:   [\"Cell 1\", \"Cell 2\"]\n272: ], {\n273:   x: 1, y: 1, w: 8, h: 2,\n274:   border: { pt: 1, color: \"999999\" }, fill: { color: \"F1F1F1\" }\n275: });\n276: \n277: // Advanced with merged cells\n278: let tableData = [\n279:   [{ text: \"Header\", options: { fill: { color: \"6699CC\" }, color: \"FFFFFF\", bold: true } }, \"Cell\"],\n280:   [{ text: \"Merged\", options: { colspan: 2 } }]\n281: ];\n282: slide.addTable(tableData, { x: 1, y: 3.5, w: 8, colW: [4, 4] });\n283: ```\n284: \n285: ---\n286: \n287: ## Charts\n288: \n289: ```javascript\n290: // Bar chart\n291: slide.addChart(pres.charts.BAR, [{\n292:   name: \"Sales\", labels: [\"Q1\", \"Q2\", \"Q3\", \"Q4\"], values: [4500, 5500, 6200, 7100]\n293: }], {\n294:   x: 0.5, y: 0.6, w: 6, h: 3, barDir: 'col',\n295:   showTitle: true, title: 'Quarterly Sales'\n296: });\n297: \n298: // Line chart\n299: slide.addChart(pres.charts.LINE, [{\n300:   name: \"Temp\", labels: [\"Jan\", \"Feb\", \"Mar\"], values: [32, 35, 42]\n301: }], { x: 0.5, y: 4, w: 6, h: 3, lineSize: 3, lineSmooth: true });\n302: \n303: // Pie chart\n304: slide.addChart(pres.charts.PIE, [{\n305:   name: \"Share\", labels: [\"A\", \"B\", \"Other\"], values: [35, 45, 20]\n306: }], { x: 7, y: 1, w: 5, h: 4, showPercent: true });\n307: ```\n308: \n309: ### Better-Looking Charts\n310: \n311: Default charts look dated. Apply these options for a modern, clean appearance:\n312: \n313: ```javascript\n314: slide.addChart(pres.charts.BAR, chartData, {\n315:   x: 0.5, y: 1, w: 9, h: 4, barDir: \"col\",\n316: \n317:   // Custom colors (match your presentation palette)\n318:   chartColors: [\"0D9488\", \"14B8A6\", \"5EEAD4\"],\n319: \n320:   // Clean background\n321:   chartArea: { fill: { color: \"FFFFFF\" }, roundedCorners: true },\n322: \n323:   // Muted axis labels\n324:   catAxisLabelColor: \"64748B\",\n325:   valAxisLabelColor: \"64748B\",\n326: \n327:   // Subtle grid (value axis only)\n328:   valGridLine: { color: \"E2E8F0\", size: 0.5 },\n329:   catGridLine: { style: \"none\" },\n330: \n331:   // Data labels on bars\n332:   showValue: true,\n333:   dataLabelPosition: \"outEnd\",\n334:   dataLabelColor: \"1E293B\",\n335: \n336:   // Hide legend for single series\n337:   showLegend: false,\n338: });\n339: ```\n340: \n341: **Key styling options:**\n342: - `chartColors: [...]` - hex colors for series/segments\n343: - `chartArea: { fill, border, roundedCorners }` - chart background\n344: - `catGridLine/valGridLine: { color, style, size }` - grid lines (`style: \"none\"` to hide)\n345: - `lineSmooth: true` - curved lines (line charts)\n346: - `legendPos: \"r\"` - legend position: \"b\", \"t\", \"l\", \"r\", \"tr\"\n347: \n348: ---\n349: \n350: ## Slide Masters\n351: \n352: ```javascript\n353: pres.defineSlideMaster({\n354:   title: 'TITLE_SLIDE', background: { color: '283A5E' },\n355:   objects: [{\n356:     placeholder: { options: { name: 'title', type: 'title', x: 1, y: 2, w: 8, h: 2 } }\n357:   }]\n358: });\n359: \n360: let titleSlide = pres.addSlide({ masterName: \"TITLE_SLIDE\" });\n361: titleSlide.addText(\"My Title\", { placeholder: \"title\" });\n362: ```\n363: \n364: ---\n365: \n366: ## Common Pitfalls\n367: \n368: ⚠️ These issues cause file corruption, visual bugs, or broken output. Avoid them.\n369: \n370: 1. **NEVER use \"#\" with hex colors** - causes file corruption\n371:    ```javascript\n372:    color: \"FF0000\"      // ✅ CORRECT\n373:    color: \"#FF0000\"     // ❌ WRONG\n374:    ```\n375: \n376: 2. **NEVER encode opacity in hex color strings** - 8-char colors (e.g., `\"00000020\"`) corrupt the file. Use the `opacity` property instead.\n377:    ```javascript\n378:    shadow: { type: \"outer\", blur: 6, offset: 2, color: \"00000020\" }          // ❌ CORRUPTS FILE\n379:    shadow: { type: \"outer\", blur: 6, offset: 2, color: \"000000\", opacity: 0.12 }  // ✅ CORRECT\n380:    ```\n381: \n382: 3. **Use `bullet: true`** - NEVER unicode symbols like \"•\" (creates double bullets)\n383: \n384: 4. **Use `breakLine: true`** between array items or text runs together\n385: \n386: 5. **Avoid `lineSpacing` with bullets** - causes excessive gaps; use `paraSpaceAfter` instead\n387: \n388: 6. **Each presentation needs fresh instance** - don't reuse `pptxgen()` objects\n389: \n390: 7. **NEVER reuse option objects across calls** - PptxGenJS mutates objects in-place (e.g. converting shadow values to EMU). Sharing one object between multiple calls corrupts the second shape.\n391:    ```javascript\n392:    const shadow = { type: \"outer\", blur: 6, offset: 2, color: \"000000\", opacity: 0.15 };\n393:    slide.addShape(pres.shapes.RECTANGLE, { shadow, ... });  // ❌ second call gets already-converted values\n394:    slide.addShape(pres.shapes.RECTANGLE, { shadow, ... });\n395: \n396:    const makeShadow = () => ({ type: \"outer\", blur: 6, offset: 2, color: \"000000\", opacity: 0.15 });\n397:    slide.addShape(pres.shapes.RECTANGLE, { shadow: makeShadow(), ... });  // ✅ fresh object each time\n398:    slide.addShape(pres.shapes.RECTANGLE, { shadow: makeShadow(), ... });\n399:    ```\n400: \n401: 8. **Don't use `ROUNDED_RECTANGLE` with accent borders** - rectangular overlay bars won't cover rounded corners. Use `RECTANGLE` instead.\n402:    ```javascript\n403:    // ❌ WRONG: Accent bar doesn't cover rounded corners\n404:    slide.addShape(pres.shapes.ROUNDED_RECTANGLE, { x: 1, y: 1, w: 3, h: 1.5, fill: { color: \"FFFFFF\" } });\n405:    slide.addShape(pres.shapes.RECTANGLE, { x: 1, y: 1, w: 0.08, h: 1.5, fill: { color: \"0891B2\" } });\n406: \n407:    // ✅ CORRECT: Use RECTANGLE for clean alignment\n408:    slide.addShape(pres.shapes.RECTANGLE, { x: 1, y: 1, w: 3, h: 1.5, fill: { color: \"FFFFFF\" } });\n409:    slide.addShape(pres.shapes.RECTANGLE, { x: 1, y: 1, w: 0.08, h: 1.5, fill: { color: \"0891B2\" } });\n410:    ```\n411: \n412: ---\n413: \n414: ## Quick Reference\n415: \n416: - **Shapes**: RECTANGLE, OVAL, LINE, ROUNDED_RECTANGLE\n417: - **Charts**: BAR, LINE, PIE, DOUGHNUT, SCATTER, BUBBLE, RADAR\n418: - **Layouts**: LAYOUT_16x9 (10\"×5.625\"), LAYOUT_16x10, LAYOUT_4x3, LAYOUT_WIDE\n419: - **Alignment**: \"left\", \"center\", \"right\"\n420: - **Chart data labels**: \"outEnd\", \"inEnd\", \"center\"\n\n(End of file - total 420 lines)\n</content>"}],"isError":false}],"role":"user","id":"19a7d324-ee0f-4b96-9ec1-d5f9e0a931fd"},"meta":{"path":"C:\\Users\\xiaowenbo\\.agents\\skills\\pptx\\pptxgenjs.md","offset":1,"lines":[{"number":1,"text":"# PptxGenJS Tutorial"},{"number":2,"text":""},{"number":3,"text":"## Setup & Basic Structure"},{"number":4,"text":""},{"number":5,"text":"```javascript"},{"number":6,"text":"const pptxgen = require(\"pptxgenjs\");"},{"number":7,"text":""},{"number":8,"text":"let pres = new pptxgen();"},{"number":9,"text":"pres.layout = 'LAYOUT_16x9';  // or 'LAYOUT_16x10', 'LAYOUT_4x3', 'LAYOUT_WIDE'"},{"number":10,"text":"pres.author = 'Your Name';"},{"number":11,"text":"pres.title = 'Presentation Title';"},{"number":12,"text":""},{"number":13,"text":"let slide = pres.addSlide();"},{"number":14,"text":"slide.addText(\"Hello World!\", { x: 0.5, y: 0.5, fontSize: 36, color: \"363636\" });"},{"number":15,"text":""},{"number":16,"text":"pres.writeFile({ fileName: \"Presentation.pptx\" });"},{"number":17,"text":"```"},{"number":18,"text":""},{"number":19,"text":"## Layout Dimensions"},{"number":20,"text":""},{"number":21,"text":"Slide dimensions (coordinates in inches):"},{"number":22,"text":"- `LAYOUT_16x9`: 10\" × 5.625\" (default)"},{"number":23,"text":"- `LAYOUT_16x10`: 10\" × 6.25\""},{"number":24,"text":"- `LAYOUT_4x3`: 10\" × 7.5\""},{"number":25,"text":"- `LAYOUT_WIDE`: 13.3\" × 7.5\""},{"number":26,"text":""},{"number":27,"text":"---"},{"number":28,"text":""},{"number":29,"text":"## Text & Formatting"},{"number":30,"text":""},{"number":31,"text":"```javascript"},{"number":32,"text":"// Basic text"},{"number":33,"text":"slide.addText(\"Simple Text\", {"},{"number":34,"text":"  x: 1, y: 1, w: 8, h: 2, fontSize: 24, fontFace: \"Arial\","},{"number":35,"text":"  color: \"363636\", bold: true, align: \"center\", valign: \"middle\""},{"number":36,"text":"});"},{"number":37,"text":""},{"number":38,"text":"// Character spacing (use charSpacing, not letterSpacing which is silently ignored)"},{"number":39,"text":"slide.addText(\"SPACED TEXT\", { x: 1, y: 1, w: 8, h: 1, charSpacing: 6 });"},{"number":40,"text":""},{"number":41,"text":"// Rich text arrays"},{"number":42,"text":"slide.addText(["},{"number":43,"text":"  { text: \"Bold \", options: { bold: true } },"},{"number":44,"text":"  { text: \"Italic \", options: { italic: true } }"},{"number":45,"text":"], { x: 1, y: 3, w: 8, h: 1 });"},{"number":46,"text":""},{"number":47,"text":"// Multi-line text (requires breakLine: true)"},{"number":48,"text":"slide.addText(["},{"number":49,"text":"  { text: \"Line 1\", options: { breakLine: true } },"},{"number":50,"text":"  { text: \"Line 2\", options: { breakLine: true } },"},{"number":51,"text":"  { text: \"Line 3\" }  // Last item doesn't need breakLine"},{"number":52,"text":"], { x: 0.5, y: 0.5, w: 8, h: 2 });"},{"number":53,"text":""},{"number":54,"text":"// Text box margin (internal padding)"},{"number":55,"text":"slide.addText(\"Title\", {"},{"number":56,"text":"  x: 0.5, y: 0.3, w: 9, h: 0.6,"},{"number":57,"text":"  margin: 0  // Use 0 when aligning text with other elements like shapes or icons"},{"number":58,"text":"});"},{"number":59,"text":"```"},{"number":60,"text":""},{"number":61,"text":"**Tip:** Text boxes have internal margin by default. Set `margin: 0` when you need text to align precisely with shapes, lines, or icons at the same x-position."},{"number":62,"text":""},{"number":63,"text":"---"},{"number":64,"text":""},{"number":65,"text":"## Lists & Bullets"},{"number":66,"text":""},{"number":67,"text":"```javascript"},{"number":68,"text":"// ✅ CORRECT: Multiple bullets"},{"number":69,"text":"slide.addText(["},{"number":70,"text":"  { text: \"First item\", options: { bullet: true, breakLine: true } },"},{"number":71,"text":"  { text: \"Second item\", options: { bullet: true, breakLine: true } },"},{"number":72,"text":"  { text: \"Third item\", options: { bullet: true } }"},{"number":73,"text":"], { x: 0.5, y: 0.5, w: 8, h: 3 });"},{"number":74,"text":""},{"number":75,"text":"// ❌ WRONG: Never use unicode bullets"},{"number":76,"text":"slide.addText(\"• First item\", { ... });  // Creates double bullets"},{"number":77,"text":""},{"number":78,"text":"// Sub-items and numbered lists"},{"number":79,"text":"{ text: \"Sub-item\", options: { bullet: true, indentLevel: 1 } }"},{"number":80,"text":"{ text: \"First\", options: { bullet: { type: \"number\" }, breakLine: true } }"},{"number":81,"text":"```"},{"number":82,"text":""},{"number":83,"text":"---"},{"number":84,"text":""},{"number":85,"text":"## Shapes"},{"number":86,"text":""},{"number":87,"text":"```javascript"},{"number":88,"text":"slide.addShape(pres.shapes.RECTANGLE, {"},{"number":89,"text":"  x: 0.5, y: 0.8, w: 1.5, h: 3.0,"},{"number":90,"text":"  fill: { color: \"FF0000\" }, line: { color: \"000000\", width: 2 }"},{"number":91,"text":"});"},{"number":92,"text":""},{"number":93,"text":"slide.addShape(pres.shapes.OVAL, { x: 4, y: 1, w: 2, h: 2, fill: { color: \"0000FF\" } });"},{"number":94,"text":""},{"number":95,"text":"slide.addShape(pres.shapes.LINE, {"},{"number":96,"text":"  x: 1, y: 3, w: 5, h: 0, line: { color: \"FF0000\", width: 3, dashType: \"dash\" }"},{"number":97,"text":"});"},{"number":98,"text":""},{"number":99,"text":"// With transparency"},{"number":100,"text":"slide.addShape(pres.shapes.RECTANGLE, {"},{"number":101,"text":"  x: 1, y: 1, w: 3, h: 2,"},{"number":102,"text":"  fill: { color: \"0088CC\", transparency: 50 }"},{"number":103,"text":"});"},{"number":104,"text":""},{"number":105,"text":"// Rounded rectangle (rectRadius only works with ROUNDED_RECTANGLE, not RECTANGLE)"},{"number":106,"text":"// ⚠️ Don't pair with rectangular accent overlays — they won't cover rounded corners. Use RECTANGLE instead."},{"number":107,"text":"slide.addShape(pres.shapes.ROUNDED_RECTANGLE, {"},{"number":108,"text":"  x: 1, y: 1, w: 3, h: 2,"},{"number":109,"text":"  fill: { color: \"FFFFFF\" }, rectRadius: 0.1"},{"number":110,"text":"});"},{"number":111,"text":""},{"number":112,"text":"// With shadow"},{"number":113,"text":"slide.addShape(pres.shapes.RECTANGLE, {"},{"number":114,"text":"  x: 1, y: 1, w: 3, h: 2,"},{"number":115,"text":"  fill: { color: \"FFFFFF\" },"},{"number":116,"text":"  shadow: { type: \"outer\", color: \"000000\", blur: 6, offset: 2, angle: 135, opacity: 0.15 }"},{"number":117,"text":"});"},{"number":118,"text":"```"},{"number":119,"text":""},{"number":120,"text":"Shadow options:"},{"number":121,"text":""},{"number":122,"text":"| Property | Type | Range | Notes |"},{"number":123,"text":"|----------|------|-------|-------|"},{"number":124,"text":"| `type` | string | `\"outer\"`, `\"inner\"` | |"},{"number":125,"text":"| `color` | string | 6-char hex (e.g. `\"000000\"`) | No `#` prefix, no 8-char hex — see Common Pitfalls |"},{"number":126,"text":"| `blur` | number | 0-100 pt | |"},{"number":127,"text":"| `offset` | number | 0-200 pt | **Must be non-negative** — negative values corrupt the file |"},{"number":128,"text":"| `angle` | number | 0-359 degrees | Direction the shadow falls (135 = bottom-right, 270 = upward) |"},{"number":129,"text":"| `opacity` | number | 0.0-1.0 | Use this for transparency, never encode in color string |"},{"number":130,"text":""},{"number":131,"text":"To cast a shadow upward (e.g. on a footer bar), use `angle: 270` with a positive offset — do **not** use a negative offset."},{"number":132,"text":""},{"number":133,"text":"**Note**: Gradient fills are not natively supported. Use a gradient image as a background instead."},{"number":134,"text":""},{"number":135,"text":"---"},{"number":136,"text":""},{"number":137,"text":"## Images"},{"number":138,"text":""},{"number":139,"text":"### Image Sources"},{"number":140,"text":""},{"number":141,"text":"```javascript"},{"number":142,"text":"// From file path"},{"number":143,"text":"slide.addImage({ path: \"images/chart.png\", x: 1, y: 1, w: 5, h: 3 });"},{"number":144,"text":""},{"number":145,"text":"// From URL"},{"number":146,"text":"slide.addImage({ path: \"https://example.com/image.jpg\", x: 1, y: 1, w: 5, h: 3 });"},{"number":147,"text":""},{"number":148,"text":"// From base64 (faster, no file I/O)"},{"number":149,"text":"slide.addImage({ data: \"image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgo...\", x: 1, y: 1, w: 5, h: 3 });"},{"number":150,"text":"```"},{"number":151,"text":""},{"number":152,"text":"### Image Options"},{"number":153,"text":""},{"number":154,"text":"```javascript"},{"number":155,"text":"slide.addImage({"},{"number":156,"text":"  path: \"image.png\","},{"number":157,"text":"  x: 1, y: 1, w: 5, h: 3,"},{"number":158,"text":"  rotate: 45,              // 0-359 degrees"},{"number":159,"text":"  rounding: true,          // Circular crop"},{"number":160,"text":"  transparency: 50,        // 0-100"},{"number":161,"text":"  flipH: true,             // Horizontal flip"},{"number":162,"text":"  flipV: false,            // Vertical flip"},{"number":163,"text":"  altText: \"Description\",  // Accessibility"},{"number":164,"text":"  hyperlink: { url: \"https://example.com\" }"},{"number":165,"text":"});"},{"number":166,"text":"```"},{"number":167,"text":""},{"number":168,"text":"### Image Sizing Modes"},{"number":169,"text":""},{"number":170,"text":"```javascript"},{"number":171,"text":"// Contain - fit inside, preserve ratio"},{"number":172,"text":"{ sizing: { type: 'contain', w: 4, h: 3 } }"},{"number":173,"text":""},{"number":174,"text":"// Cover - fill area, preserve ratio (may crop)"},{"number":175,"text":"{ sizing: { type: 'cover', w: 4, h: 3 } }"},{"number":176,"text":""},{"number":177,"text":"// Crop - cut specific portion"},{"number":178,"text":"{ sizing: { type: 'crop', x: 0.5, y: 0.5, w: 2, h: 2 } }"},{"number":179,"text":"```"},{"number":180,"text":""},{"number":181,"text":"### Calculate Dimensions (preserve aspect ratio)"},{"number":182,"text":""},{"number":183,"text":"```javascript"},{"number":184,"text":"const origWidth = 1978, origHeight = 923, maxHeight = 3.0;"},{"number":185,"text":"const calcWidth = maxHeight * (origWidth / origHeight);"},{"number":186,"text":"const centerX = (10 - calcWidth) / 2;"},{"number":187,"text":""},{"number":188,"text":"slide.addImage({ path: \"image.png\", x: centerX, y: 1.2, w: calcWidth, h: maxHeight });"},{"number":189,"text":"```"},{"number":190,"text":""},{"number":191,"text":"### Supported Formats"},{"number":192,"text":""},{"number":193,"text":"- **Standard**: PNG, JPG, GIF (animated GIFs work in Microsoft 365)"},{"number":194,"text":"- **SVG**: Works in modern PowerPoint/Microsoft 365"},{"number":195,"text":""},{"number":196,"text":"---"},{"number":197,"text":""},{"number":198,"text":"## Icons"},{"number":199,"text":""},{"number":200,"text":"Use react-icons to generate SVG icons, then rasterize to PNG for universal compatibility."},{"number":201,"text":""},{"number":202,"text":"### Setup"},{"number":203,"text":""},{"number":204,"text":"```javascript"},{"number":205,"text":"const React = require(\"react\");"},{"number":206,"text":"const ReactDOMServer = require(\"react-dom/server\");"},{"number":207,"text":"const sharp = require(\"sharp\");"},{"number":208,"text":"const { FaCheckCircle, FaChartLine } = require(\"react-icons/fa\");"},{"number":209,"text":""},{"number":210,"text":"function renderIconSvg(IconComponent, color = \"#000000\", size = 256) {"},{"number":211,"text":"  return ReactDOMServer.renderToStaticMarkup("},{"number":212,"text":"    React.createElement(IconComponent, { color, size: String(size) })"},{"number":213,"text":"  );"},{"number":214,"text":"}"},{"number":215,"text":""},{"number":216,"text":"async function iconToBase64Png(IconComponent, color, size = 256) {"},{"number":217,"text":"  const svg = renderIconSvg(IconComponent, color, size);"},{"number":218,"text":"  const pngBuffer = await sharp(Buffer.from(svg)).png().toBuffer();"},{"number":219,"text":"  return \"image/png;base64,\" + pngBuffer.toString(\"base64\");"},{"number":220,"text":"}"},{"number":221,"text":"```"},{"number":222,"text":""},{"number":223,"text":"### Add Icon to Slide"},{"number":224,"text":""},{"number":225,"text":"```javascript"},{"number":226,"text":"const iconData = await iconToBase64Png(FaCheckCircle, \"#4472C4\", 256);"},{"number":227,"text":""},{"number":228,"text":"slide.addImage({"},{"number":229,"text":"  data: iconData,"},{"number":230,"text":"  x: 1, y: 1, w: 0.5, h: 0.5  // Size in inches"},{"number":231,"text":"});"},{"number":232,"text":"```"},{"number":233,"text":""},{"number":234,"text":"**Note**: Use size 256 or higher for crisp icons. The size parameter controls the rasterization resolution, not the display size on the slide (which is set by `w` and `h` in inches)."},{"number":235,"text":""},{"number":236,"text":"### Icon Libraries"},{"number":237,"text":""},{"number":238,"text":"Install: `npm install -g react-icons react react-dom sharp`"},{"number":239,"text":""},{"number":240,"text":"Popular icon sets in react-icons:"},{"number":241,"text":"- `react-icons/fa` - Font Awesome"},{"number":242,"text":"- `react-icons/md` - Material Design"},{"number":243,"text":"- `react-icons/hi` - Heroicons"},{"number":244,"text":"- `react-icons/bi` - Bootstrap Icons"},{"number":245,"text":""},{"number":246,"text":"---"},{"number":247,"text":""},{"number":248,"text":"## Slide Backgrounds"},{"number":249,"text":""},{"number":250,"text":"```javascript"},{"number":251,"text":"// Solid color"},{"number":252,"text":"slide.background = { color: \"F1F1F1\" };"},{"number":253,"text":""},{"number":254,"text":"// Color with transparency"},{"number":255,"text":"slide.background = { color: \"FF3399\", transparency: 50 };"},{"number":256,"text":""},{"number":257,"text":"// Image from URL"},{"number":258,"text":"slide.background = { path: \"https://example.com/bg.jpg\" };"},{"number":259,"text":""},{"number":260,"text":"// Image from base64"},{"number":261,"text":"slide.background = { data: \"image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgo...\" };"},{"number":262,"text":"```"},{"number":263,"text":""},{"number":264,"text":"---"},{"number":265,"text":""},{"number":266,"text":"## Tables"},{"number":267,"text":""},{"number":268,"text":"```javascript"},{"number":269,"text":"slide.addTable(["},{"number":270,"text":"  [\"Header 1\", \"Header 2\"],"},{"number":271,"text":"  [\"Cell 1\", \"Cell 2\"]"},{"number":272,"text":"], {"},{"number":273,"text":"  x: 1, y: 1, w: 8, h: 2,"},{"number":274,"text":"  border: { pt: 1, color: \"999999\" }, fill: { color: \"F1F1F1\" }"},{"number":275,"text":"});"},{"number":276,"text":""},{"number":277,"text":"// Advanced with merged cells"},{"number":278,"text":"let tableData = ["},{"number":279,"text":"  [{ text: \"Header\", options: { fill: { color: \"6699CC\" }, color: \"FFFFFF\", bold: true } }, \"Cell\"],"},{"number":280,"text":"  [{ text: \"Merged\", options: { colspan: 2 } }]"},{"number":281,"text":"];"},{"number":282,"text":"slide.addTable(tableData, { x: 1, y: 3.5, w: 8, colW: [4, 4] });"},{"number":283,"text":"```"},{"number":284,"text":""},{"number":285,"text":"---"},{"number":286,"text":""},{"number":287,"text":"## Charts"},{"number":288,"text":""},{"number":289,"text":"```javascript"},{"number":290,"text":"// Bar chart"},{"number":291,"text":"slide.addChart(pres.charts.BAR, [{"},{"number":292,"text":"  name: \"Sales\", labels: [\"Q1\", \"Q2\", \"Q3\", \"Q4\"], values: [4500, 5500, 6200, 7100]"},{"number":293,"text":"}], {"},{"number":294,"text":"  x: 0.5, y: 0.6, w: 6, h: 3, barDir: 'col',"},{"number":295,"text":"  showTitle: true, title: 'Quarterly Sales'"},{"number":296,"text":"});"},{"number":297,"text":""},{"number":298,"text":"// Line chart"},{"number":299,"text":"slide.addChart(pres.charts.LINE, [{"},{"number":300,"text":"  name: \"Temp\", labels: [\"Jan\", \"Feb\", \"Mar\"], values: [32, 35, 42]"},{"number":301,"text":"}], { x: 0.5, y: 4, w: 6, h: 3, lineSize: 3, lineSmooth: true });"},{"number":302,"text":""},{"number":303,"text":"// Pie chart"},{"number":304,"text":"slide.addChart(pres.charts.PIE, [{"},{"number":305,"text":"  name: \"Share\", labels: [\"A\", \"B\", \"Other\"], values: [35, 45, 20]"},{"number":306,"text":"}], { x: 7, y: 1, w: 5, h: 4, showPercent: true });"},{"number":307,"text":"```"},{"number":308,"text":""},{"number":309,"text":"### Better-Looking Charts"},{"number":310,"text":""},{"number":311,"text":"Default charts look dated. Apply these options for a modern, clean appearance:"},{"number":312,"text":""},{"number":313,"text":"```javascript"},{"number":314,"text":"slide.addChart(pres.charts.BAR, chartData, {"},{"number":315,"text":"  x: 0.5, y: 1, w: 9, h: 4, barDir: \"col\","},{"number":316,"text":""},{"number":317,"text":"  // Custom colors (match your presentation palette)"},{"number":318,"text":"  chartColors: [\"0D9488\", \"14B8A6\", \"5EEAD4\"],"},{"number":319,"text":""},{"number":320,"text":"  // Clean background"},{"number":321,"text":"  chartArea: { fill: { color: \"FFFFFF\" }, roundedCorners: true },"},{"number":322,"text":""},{"number":323,"text":"  // Muted axis labels"},{"number":324,"text":"  catAxisLabelColor: \"64748B\","},{"number":325,"text":"  valAxisLabelColor: \"64748B\","},{"number":326,"text":""},{"number":327,"text":"  // Subtle grid (value axis only)"},{"number":328,"text":"  valGridLine: { color: \"E2E8F0\", size: 0.5 },"},{"number":329,"text":"  catGridLine: { style: \"none\" },"},{"number":330,"text":""},{"number":331,"text":"  // Data labels on bars"},{"number":332,"text":"  showValue: true,"},{"number":333,"text":"  dataLabelPosition: \"outEnd\","},{"number":334,"text":"  dataLabelColor: \"1E293B\","},{"number":335,"text":""},{"number":336,"text":"  // Hide legend for single series"},{"number":337,"text":"  showLegend: false,"},{"number":338,"text":"});"},{"number":339,"text":"```"},{"number":340,"text":""},{"number":341,"text":"**Key styling options:**"},{"number":342,"text":"- `chartColors: [...]` - hex colors for series/segments"},{"number":343,"text":"- `chartArea: { fill, border, roundedCorners }` - chart background"},{"number":344,"text":"- `catGridLine/valGridLine: { color, style, size }` - grid lines (`style: \"none\"` to hide)"},{"number":345,"text":"- `lineSmooth: true` - curved lines (line charts)"},{"number":346,"text":"- `legendPos: \"r\"` - legend position: \"b\", \"t\", \"l\", \"r\", \"tr\""},{"number":347,"text":""},{"number":348,"text":"---"},{"number":349,"text":""},{"number":350,"text":"## Slide Masters"},{"number":351,"text":""},{"number":352,"text":"```javascript"},{"number":353,"text":"pres.defineSlideMaster({"},{"number":354,"text":"  title: 'TITLE_SLIDE', background: { color: '283A5E' },"},{"number":355,"text":"  objects: [{"},{"number":356,"text":"    placeholder: { options: { name: 'title', type: 'title', x: 1, y: 2, w: 8, h: 2 } }"},{"number":357,"text":"  }]"},{"number":358,"text":"});"},{"number":359,"text":""},{"number":360,"text":"let titleSlide = pres.addSlide({ masterName: \"TITLE_SLIDE\" });"},{"number":361,"text":"titleSlide.addText(\"My Title\", { placeholder: \"title\" });"},{"number":362,"text":"```"},{"number":363,"text":""},{"number":364,"text":"---"},{"number":365,"text":""},{"number":366,"text":"## Common Pitfalls"},{"number":367,"text":""},{"number":368,"text":"⚠️ These issues cause file corruption, visual bugs, or broken output. Avoid them."},{"number":369,"text":""},{"number":370,"text":"1. **NEVER use \"#\" with hex colors** - causes file corruption"},{"number":371,"text":"   ```javascript"},{"number":372,"text":"   color: \"FF0000\"      // ✅ CORRECT"},{"number":373,"text":"   color: \"#FF0000\"     // ❌ WRONG"},{"number":374,"text":"   ```"},{"number":375,"text":""},{"number":376,"text":"2. **NEVER encode opacity in hex color strings** - 8-char colors (e.g., `\"00000020\"`) corrupt the file. Use the `opacity` property instead."},{"number":377,"text":"   ```javascript"},{"number":378,"text":"   shadow: { type: \"outer\", blur: 6, offset: 2, color: \"00000020\" }          // ❌ CORRUPTS FILE"},{"number":379,"text":"   shadow: { type: \"outer\", blur: 6, offset: 2, color: \"000000\", opacity: 0.12 }  // ✅ CORRECT"},{"number":380,"text":"   ```"},{"number":381,"text":""},{"number":382,"text":"3. **Use `bullet: true`** - NEVER unicode symbols like \"•\" (creates double bullets)"},{"number":383,"text":""},{"number":384,"text":"4. **Use `breakLine: true`** between array items or text runs together"},{"number":385,"text":""},{"number":386,"text":"5. **Avoid `lineSpacing` with bullets** - causes excessive gaps; use `paraSpaceAfter` instead"},{"number":387,"text":""},{"number":388,"text":"6. **Each presentation needs fresh instance** - don't reuse `pptxgen()` objects"},{"number":389,"text":""},{"number":390,"text":"7. **NEVER reuse option objects across calls** - PptxGenJS mutates objects in-place (e.g. converting shadow values to EMU). Sharing one object between multiple calls corrupts the second shape."},{"number":391,"text":"   ```javascript"},{"number":392,"text":"   const shadow = { type: \"outer\", blur: 6, offset: 2, color: \"000000\", opacity: 0.15 };"},{"number":393,"text":"   slide.addShape(pres.shapes.RECTANGLE, { shadow, ... });  // ❌ second call gets already-converted values"},{"number":394,"text":"   slide.addShape(pres.shapes.RECTANGLE, { shadow, ... });"},{"number":395,"text":""},{"number":396,"text":"   const makeShadow = () => ({ type: \"outer\", blur: 6, offset: 2, color: \"000000\", opacity: 0.15 });"},{"number":397,"text":"   slide.addShape(pres.shapes.RECTANGLE, { shadow: makeShadow(), ... });  // ✅ fresh object each time"},{"number":398,"text":"   slide.addShape(pres.shapes.RECTANGLE, { shadow: makeShadow(), ... });"},{"number":399,"text":"   ```"},{"number":400,"text":""},{"number":401,"text":"8. **Don't use `ROUNDED_RECTANGLE` with accent borders** - rectangular overlay bars won't cover rounded corners. Use `RECTANGLE` instead."},{"number":402,"text":"   ```javascript"},{"number":403,"text":"   // ❌ WRONG: Accent bar doesn't cover rounded corners"},{"number":404,"text":"   slide.addShape(pres.shapes.ROUNDED_RECTANGLE, { x: 1, y: 1, w: 3, h: 1.5, fill: { color: \"FFFFFF\" } });"},{"number":405,"text":"   slide.addShape(pres.shapes.RECTANGLE, { x: 1, y: 1, w: 0.08, h: 1.5, fill: { color: \"0891B2\" } });"},{"number":406,"text":""},{"number":407,"text":"   // ✅ CORRECT: Use RECTANGLE for clean alignment"},{"number":408,"text":"   slide.addShape(pres.shapes.RECTANGLE, { x: 1, y: 1, w: 3, h: 1.5, fill: { color: \"FFFFFF\" } });"},{"number":409,"text":"   slide.addShape(pres.shapes.RECTANGLE, { x: 1, y: 1, w: 0.08, h: 1.5, fill: { color: \"0891B2\" } });"},{"number":410,"text":"   ```"},{"number":411,"text":""},{"number":412,"text":"---"},{"number":413,"text":""},{"number":414,"text":"## Quick Reference"},{"number":415,"text":""},{"number":416,"text":"- **Shapes**: RECTANGLE, OVAL, LINE, ROUNDED_RECTANGLE"},{"number":417,"text":"- **Charts**: BAR, LINE, PIE, DOUGHNUT, SCATTER, BUBBLE, RADAR"},{"number":418,"text":"- **Layouts**: LAYOUT_16x9 (10\"×5.625\"), LAYOUT_16x10, LAYOUT_4x3, LAYOUT_WIDE"},{"number":419,"text":"- **Alignment**: \"left\", \"center\", \"right\""},{"number":420,"text":"- **Chart data labels**: \"outEnd\", \"inEnd\", \"center\""}],"totalLines":420,"lang":"md"}},"sourceEventSeqs":[75],"surfaceOp":"append"}
