can build a pie-like horizontal bar using charts)\n4. 两重点一重大 (4/4/4 + 危化 5) — big stat callouts, bar chart\n5. 安全管理 (风险A级, 禁限控79/80, 承诺公告23, 第三方8, 安全基础4/4/4) + 绿色低碳\n6. 园区经济与产值趋势 (2023-2026 表格/bar chart of 总产值; 主营收入 odd numbers (54555 etc. could be messy), use 总产值 bar chart)\n7. 人员学历与创新 (学历分布 bar chart 120本科..., 专利0)\n8. 入驻企业清单 top10 table (10 rows table)\n9. 数据说明与备注 (notes)\n\nMaybe 8-10 slides total. Theme: 化工园区 -> could use a \"deep blue + safety orange\" palette. Let me pick palette inspired by chemical safety dashboard: Midnight Executive navy + safety accent orange. Or \"Ocean Gradient\". Chemical park safety — dark navy + amber/orange accent reads as \"safety/industrial\". I'll go with:\n\n- Primary: 0F2A43 deep navy / 1E2761? Let me craft custom: \n  - Deep: 0B2B4F (navy)\n  - Mid: 176B87 (teal blue)\n  - Accent: F2A104 (amber/safety orange)\n  - Light bg: F4F7FA\n  - Text dark: 1B2A38\n\nThat's a designed, content-informed palette (industrial safety dashboard).\n\nStructure motif: use side accent bars or \"stat card\" rectangles with top accent strip; rounded icons in circles.\n\nSince drawing true charts via pptxgenjs addChart is possible. But charts rendering in LibreOffice PDF should be fine.\n\nBetter to check environment first: node, pptxgenjs availability.\n\nActually simpler and consistent: create chart images? No—use pptxgenjs charts directly, they embed native charts. QA via soffice conversion requires LibreOffice. Let me check tools availability. If soffice not available, visual QA is harder. Let's check.\n\nNote also user's environment may not have node/npm/pptxgenjs. Check.\n\nPlan:\n1. Check node, npm, pptxgenjs global, soffice, pdftoppm availability.\n2. Write generator js.\n3. Run, convert to pdf, to images, visually QA (maybe subagent for inspection per skill; but reading images directly is fine too — the skill says use subagents. I can read the images with read_image myself as well. Skill instructs to use subagents with fresh eyes. I can do