0 dominant): 本科120 专科5 硕士4 博士4 其他4 高中0; top total 137 big.\n- Right card: 企业人才特征? Actually创新: 专利全0 -> right panel: 园区专利统计 0项 with sub rows each 0 + note 绿色工厂2家、创新中心0. Wait创新中心 belongs S3. Keep S7 right: 专利 panel: \"园区专利统计（全部类型 0 项）\" with 4 category chips 0.\n- Also bottom note: 员工口径差异 101 vs 66.\n学历 donut might be nicer with legend; but 120 dominates donut → bar better.\n\nS8 企业清单 table 10 rows; columns: # | 企业名称 | 分类 | 生产状态 | 员工 | 风险等级. Add colored risk dots? table cell text with color via options on each cell (array of objects with fill etc.) simpler plain but header styled. Row heights auto; 11 rows fits at h~0.42 rows in 4.6 area: header .5 + 10*.4=4.5. Good. Column widths: [0.6,4.3,2.3,1.6,1.0,1.6] ~11.4? plus margins fine w11.9. font 11 for rows, name bold maybe.\n\nMark risk colors: LOWRISK low (green), 较大 risk amber, 未评估 gray, GREATERRISK →较大风险显示amber. Provide left color dot in risk col text color.\n\nS9 数据说明与口径备注: numbered list notes + maybe 2-column. Light card.\n\nTotal slides = 9. plus cover = 9 slides total? count: cover(1), S2主体(2), S3发展(3), S4两重点(4), S5安全(5), S6经济(6), S7人才(7), S8企业清单(8), S9数据说明(9). \n\nSlide numbering \"2/9\".\n\nOk. Might be much to eyeball but let's do it; then render & inspect every slide; iterate.\n\nAlso footer: I'll add \"化工园区1 · 园区总览报告\" left & page right.\n\nWrite gen script to D:\\windoc\\desktop\\3\\ppt_build\\gen_park_ppt.js, run node. Where to output? D:\\windoc\\desktop\\3\\化工园区1_园区总览.pptx (workspace root) so user easily finds; but node needs full access to spawn? No spawn for node script itself except pptxgenjs writeFile uses fs. But running node may write fine under workspace-write. However previous node child spawn denied is about child processes; our script spawns none. Output writing to D:\\windoc\\desktop\\3 fine.\n\nBut wait: running `node gen.js` requires cwd = ppt_build so require('pptxgenjs') resolves. We'll pass workdir ppt_build and output absolute path to workspace root. Note earlier sandbox denied node spawning children (EPERM) — but running node itself was fine (node --version). The generator requires no spawn. Let's run under workspace-write mode normally (default), no escalation needed. If some deny occurs, escalate.\n\nThen QA: convert with soffice to PDF then pdftoppm. Need poppler pdftoppm — not found earlier (Get-Command pdftoppm empty). Alternatives: use LibreOffice to convert PPTX→PNG directly? soffice supports --convert-to png only first slide I think. Or use soffice to pdf then render pdf to images using python library pypdfium2 / pdf2image? pypdfium2 might not be installed. Could pip install pypdfium2 (pip is external spawn; pip spawns python child -> EPERM under sandbox; escalate like npm). Or use PowerShell + LibreOffice macro? Simpler: soffice --headless --convert-to pdf, then use python with PyMuPDF (fitz)? check if installed. Or use Windows built-in? Or use LibreOffice's draw to png per page: soffice --convert-to \"pdf\" then pdftoppm missing; there is also \"soffice --convert-to png:impress_png_Export\"? Hmm. LibreOffice convert-to png on pptx exports first slide only? Actually for Impress, png export may produce a single png of first slide... Some report that `--convert-to png` for presentations exports every slide in LO ≥ 7? There's an option `png:impress_png_Export` filters produce one file per slide historically (multi-page png in older versions used '--convert-to png' producing slide-N.png?). Not certain.\n\nBest: install pypdfium2 via pip with escalation, or PyMuPDF. Check python packages quickly: import fitz, import pypdfium2. If none, pip install pypdfium2 needs spawn; escalate once.\n\nAlternatively thumbnails via skill scripts/thumbnail.py requires Pillow + pdf? It converts pptx? Let me not guess; simplest path: soffice → pdf; then use LibreOffice? no. Check python libs first (no spawn): python -c import.\n\nLet me do stepwise:\n1. Write gen script.\n2. Run node gen (no escalation expected).\n3. soffice convert to pdf.\n4. render pdf pages: try python import fitz (PyMuPDF) else pypdfium2 else pip install pypdfium2 w/ escalation.\n\nAlso I can read the images directly with read_image for QA. Good.\n\nLet me write the generator now. Careful with pptxgenjs API specifics:\n- addTable row arrays; each cell string or {text, options}. For cell text object options include fill, color, bold, align, fontSize, fontFace.\n- Table borders default maybe none; style: pptxgenjs table border options: border: {type:'solid', pt, color}? Actually table-level: border: { type: \"solid\", color: \"BFBFBF\", pt: 1 } applies outer? For full grid need per-cell? pptxgenjs supports `border` on table for all cells? doc: addTable(data, { border: { pt: 0.5, color: \"...\" }}) draws cell borders? Historically sets borders on all cells. We'll see in QA.\n- Table row heights: auto.\n- colW array relative.\n\n- addShape OVAL with line only (no fill): fill:{color:'FFFFFF', transparency:100}? use fill:{color:'F4F7FA'} matches bg; or line thick amber and fill white.\n- Chart DOUGHNUT data labels & legend.\n- Chart holeSize? DOUGHNUT has holeSize option? For pie donut pptxgenjs: chart option `holeSize: 60`. Supported maybe. I'll use plain PIE if unsure. Actually DOUGHNUT supported; holeSize property exists in pptxgenjs for doughnut (percentage). I'll avoid risky opts; show legend bottom.\n\nColors const:\nNAVY='0C2D48'\nNAVY2='123A5F'? maybe '16395C'\nSTEEL='176B87'? I'll define BLUE='1F6F8B'\nACCENT='F2A104'\nRED='C93A2F'? for危险 use accent amber; red 'D64541' minor.\nBG='F2F6FA'\nCARD='FFFFFF'\nINK='20303F'\nMUTED='6B7A89'\nGREEN='2E9E6B'\nAMBERDARK='B45309'? for text on amber use navy.\n\nSection slide title font 26 bold INK; kicker 10.5 muted charSpacing 3.\n\nLet me also set pres.author etc.\n\nNow writing code... (long file). I'll be meticulous with object creation inside helpers.\n\nHelper: txt(slide, runs...) not needed; simpler create paragraphs? pptxgenjs supports arrays with breakLine.\n\nA robust approach for lines inside a textbox: pass array of {text, options:{breakLine:true, bullet, ...}}.\n\nCareful: bullet indentLevel etc.\n\nText autosize: use fit:'shrink' option to avoid overflow: pptxgenjs text option `fit: \"shrink\"` supported; helpful for titles/cells. Use fit:'shrink' for KPI numbers maybe not needed.\n\nI'll add function kpi(slide, x,y,w,h, num,label,color?) builds card + num + label: returns nothing. Fresh opts.\n\nhbar(slide, x,y,w,h,label,max,value,unit) draws track rect + fill rect (fresh) + texts: label left (dark), value right bold with unit. Value text inside right end? Put value at end of bar right side after bar? For clean: label above bar? Choose stacked rows: label small top, bar below, value chip on the bar right. Time constraints; do label at left of bar inline row: [label 1.7in][track w rest?]. Might be cramped with Chinese label width. I'll do vertical list rows: each row h0.62: label text 11 dark w3.2; track from x+3.4 to x+w-0.2; fill width = value/max*track; end value text bold at x+trackEnd+0.05? put value right after bar at fixed pos x+w-0.9 right-aligned color INK bold 12 + '/' unit none.\n\nSimpler: label width dynamic longest 危化品监管(8字) fine 3.0 at font11? ~ 8*11px*? width .15in/char ~1.2in; 3.0 plenty.\n\nTrack: RECTANGLE fill 'E3E9F0' full; fill accent over portion; value text placed at right margin.\n\nBar helper signature: hbarRow(slide, x,y,labelW,trackX,label,value,max,color,valueW).\n\nTo reduce fuss, compute inside function given card geometry:\n\nfunction hbar(slide, cx, cy, cw, rows) where rows = [{label, value, max, color}], each row: label x=cx+0.15 y=cy+i*rh+0.03 w=cw-? font 11; track x=cx+2.9 y=... w=cw-2.9-0.15-1.2( value slot) h0.26; fill w = (value/max)*(trackW) min maybe 0.02 when 0 none; value text at x=cx+cw-1.15 right align bold.\n\nLet's code each slide with these primitives. Enough planning — write.\n\nFor line segments mini-map, draw closed polygon from region points (first 10 unique points given; trailing duplicates okay). The region string: \"[[{...},...,{...}]]\" points array. Use first 10 list from data (11 pts incl. two repeats). I'll just hardcode the coordinate list used in map; scale: lngSpan=113.563-113.549=0.014, latSpan=34.8290-34.8175=0.0115.\n\nMap panel box: x=MX0,y=MY0,w=MW,h=MH with padding p=0.35.\npx = MX0+p + (lng-lngMin)/lngSpan*(MW-2p)\npy = MY0+p + (latMax-lat)/latSpan*(MH-2p)\nDraw lines connecting consecutive points: for i segments addShape LINE with line color STEEL w1.4. Close loop back to first.\nAdd center marker dot: oval 0.12 at centroid.\n\nPlace map panel on cover? no S2.\n\nOne more: cover KPI chips: to not overcrowd, 3 chips.\n\nLet me finalize slide count and footers page numbers 2..9 total 9 slides.\n\nWrite file now. It'll be ~600 lines. Then run.\n\npptxgenjs font: pres.defineFont? no need.\n\nAlso for charts: define method chartData inline fresh each call.\n\nI also want chart colors amber/steel/navy combos:\nSeries1 color for bar chart 总产值: '1F6F8B' bars, maybe per-point colors not supported simply; single color fine.\nBar chart for 学历 no—use custom bars.\n\nDonut for企业分类: chartColors ['F2A104','1F6F8B','C9D3DC','2E9E6B'] but zero slice show? values [4,2,0,4]. Pie zero ok.\nActually use企业分类 & maybe生产? S3 right uses DOUGHNUT企业分类. Labels: 危化品经营, 危化品生产, 危化品使用, 非危化行业; legend bottom.\n\nI'll show data labels count with showPercent false: showValue true, dataLabelColor INK. For pie label show value count.\n\nFine. Also table risk colors mapping text color.\n\nAlso S3 KPI chips width: 6 chips maybe w1.95 gap0.1 starting0.55: total 6*1.95+5*0.12=12.3 > 13.33-1.1 fine but leave margins: content width 12.23 (0.55..12.78). 5 chips w2.32 gap0.16 => 5*2.32+4*.16=12.24 ok.\n\nSimplify chips count 5: 入驻企业 16家 / 从业人数 101人 / 规上企业 2家 / 高新技术企业 2家 / 绿色工厂 2家.\n\nBottom note row: 另有：规下企业 4 家、国有企业 1 家、创新中心 0 家 · 员工数另一口径为 66 人. small text under cards.\n\nOK go write.\n\nAlso add per-slide \"kicker\" top mini label e.g. '02 · PARK PROFILE'.\n\nLet me write file."}}},{"type":"chunk","time":1788943804575,"chunk":{"type":"block-end","index":1,"block":{"type":"text","text":"pptxgenjs 安装成功。现在编写 PPT 生成脚本（按园区安全监管大屏风格设计 9 页）："}}},{"type":"chunk","time":1788943804575,"chunk":{"type":"block-end","index":2,"block":{"type":"tool-call","id":"call_00_9lKsvy071727A1lLcAOJ2008","name":"write","arguments":"{\"file_path\": \"D:\\\\windoc\\\\desktop\\\\3\\\\ppt_build\\\\gen_park_ppt.js\", \"content\": \"// 化工园区1 园区总览 PPT 生成脚本 (pptxgenjs)\\nconst pptxgen = require(\\\"pptxgenjs\\\");\\n\\nconst pres = new pptxgen();\\npres.layout = \\\"LAYOUT_WIDE\\\"; // 13.333 x 7.5\\npres.author = \\\"园区数据大屏\\\";\\npres.title = \\\"化工园区1 园区总览\\\";\\n\\n// ---------- palette (industrial safety dashboard) ----------\\nconst NAVY = \\\"0C2D48\\\";   // deep navy (dominant, dark slides)\\nconst NAVY2 = \\\"14395C\\\";  // lighter navy\\nconst STEEL = \\\"1F6F8B\\\";  // steel teal blue (secondary)\\nconst ACCENT = \\\"F2A104\\\"; // safety amber (accent)\\nconst AMBERD = \\\"B45309\\\";\\nconst GREEN = \\\"2E9E6B\\\";\\nconst RED = \\\"C5432F\\\";\\nconst BG = \\\"F2F6FA\\\";     // light background\\nconst CARD = \\\"FFFFFF\\\";\\nconst INK = \\\"1F2E3D\\\";\\nconst MUTED = \\\"6C7A89\\\";\\nconst TRACK = \\\"E2E8F0\\\";\\nconst FONT = \\\"微软雅黑\\\";\\nconst FF = FONT;\\n\\nconst W = 13.333, H = 7.5;\\nconst MX = 0.55; // margin\\n\\n// ---------- helpers ----------\\nfunction fresh(o) { return JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(o)); }\\n\\nfunction bg(slide, color) { slide.background = { color: color }; }\\n\\nfunction footer(slide, idx, total) {\\n  slide.addText(\\\"化工园区1 · 园区总览报告\\\", {\\n    x: MX, y: H - 0.42, w: 4.5, h: 0.3, fontFace: FF, fontSize: 8.5,\\n    color: MUTED, align: \\\"left\\\", margin: 0\\n  });\\n  slide.addText(\\\"数据源：园区大屏「园区总览」模块（16 接口）\\\", {\\n    x: W / 2 - 2.6, y: H - 0.42, w: 5.2, h: 0.3, fontFace: FF, fontSize: 8.5,\\n    color: MUTED, align: \\\"center\\\", margin: 0\\n  });\\n  slide.addText(String(idx) + \\\" / \\\" + String(total), {\\n    x: W - MX - 1.2, y: H - 0.42, w: 1.2, h: 0.3, fontFace: FF, fontSize: 8.5,\\n    color: MUTED, align: \\\"right\\\", margin: 0\\n  });\\n}\\n\\n// header on light slides: amber square + kicker + title\\nfunction header(slide, kicker, title) {\\n  slide.addShape(pres.shapes.RECTANGLE, { x: MX, y: 0.62, w: 0.14, h: 0.72, fill: { color: ACCENT } });\\n  slide.addText(kicker, {\\n    x: MX + 0.3, y: 0.3, w: 11, h: 0.28, fontFace: FF, fontSize: 10,\\n    color: STEEL, charSpacing: 3, margin: 0\\n  });\\n  slide.addText(title, {\\n    x: MX + 0.3, y: 0.52, w: 11.5, h: 0.85, fontFace: FF, fontSize: 27,\\n    bold: true, color: NAVY, margin: 0, valign: \\\"middle\\\"\\n  });\\n}\\n\\nfunction card(slide, x, y, w, h) {\\n  slide.addShape(pres.shapes.ROUNDED_RECTANGLE, {\\n    x: x, y: y, w: w, h: h, fill: { color: CARD }, rectRadius: 0.09,\\n    line: { color: \\\"E4EAF1\\\", width: 1 },\\n    shadow: { type: \\\"outer\\\", color: \\\"20364A\\\", blur: 7, offset: 2, angle: 90, opacity: 0.10 }\\n  });\\n}\\n\\nfunction cardTitle(slide, x, y, w, text, color) {\\n  slide.addShape(pres.shapes.RECTANGLE, { x: x + 0.2, y: y + 0.24, w: 0.09, h: 0.3, fill: { color: color || ACCENT } });\\n  slide.addText(text, {\\n    x: x + 0.42, y: y + 0.16, w: w - 0.6, h: 0.46, fontFace: FF, fontSize: 14,\\n    bold: true, color: INK, margin: 0, valign: \\\"middle\\\"\\n  });\\n}\\n\\n// KPI mini card: number + label\\nfunction kpi(slide, x, y, w, h, num, label, numColor) {\\n  card(slide, x, y, w, h);\\n  slide.addText(String(num), {\\n    x: x, y: y + 0.14, w: w, h: 0.72, fontFace: FF, fontSize: 30, bold: true,\\n    color: numColor || STEEL, align: \\\"center\\\", margin: 0\\n  });\\n  slide.addText(label, {\\n    x: x + 0.1, y: y + 0.9, w: w - 0.2, h: 0.34, fontFace: FF, fontSize: 10.5,\\n    color: MUTED, align: \\\"center\\\", margin: 0\\n  });\\n}\\n\\n// horizontal bar rows inside a card\\nfunction hbarRows(slide, cx, cy, cw, labelW, rows, barH) {\\n  let y = cy;\\n  rows.forEach(function (r) {\\n    slide.addText(r.label, {\\n      x: cx + 0.18, y: y - 0.06, w: labelW, h: 0.4, fontFace: FF, fontSize: 11.5,\\n      color: INK, align: \\\"left\\\", margin: 0, valign: \\\"middle\\\"\\n    });\\n    const tx = cx + 0.18 + labelW + 0.12;\\n    const tw = cw - labelW - 0.5 - 1.15;\\n    slide.addShape(pres.shapes.ROUNDED_RECTANGLE, {\\n      x: tx, y: y + 0.02, w: tw, h: barH, fill: { color: TRACK }, rectRadius: barH / 2\\n    });\\n    const frac = r.max > 0 ? Math.min(1, r.value / r.max) : 0;\\n    if (frac > 0) {\\n      slide.addShape(pres.shapes.ROUNDED_RECTANGLE, {\\n        x: tx, y: y + 0.02, w: Math.max(0.08, tw * frac), h: barH,\\n        fill: { color: r.color || STEEL }, rectRadius: barH / 2\\n      });\\n    }\\n    slide.addText(String(r.value) + (r.unit || \\\"\\\"), {\\n      x: cx + cw - 1.18, y: y - 0.08, w: 1.0, h: 0.44, fontFace: FF, fontSize: 13,\\n      bold: true, color: r.value > 0 ? INK : MUTED, align: \\\"right\\\", margin: 0, valign: \\\"middle\\\"\\n    });\\n    y += r.rowH || 0.62;\\n  });\\n}\\n\\n// ---------- Slide 1 : Cover (dark) ----------\\n{\\n  const s = pres.addSlide();\\n  bg(s, NAVY);\\n  // decorative translucent circles\\n  s.addShape(pres.shapes.OVAL, { x: 10.2, y: -1.6, w: 5.4, h: 5.4, fill: { color: NAVY2, transparency: 18 } });\\n  s.addShape(pres.shapes.OVAL, { x: 11.4, y: 4.6, w: 4.2, h: 4.2, fill: { color: NAVY2, transparency: 30 } });\\n  s.addShape(pres.shapes.OVAL, { x: -1.9, y: 4.9, w: 4.6, h: 4.6, fill: { color: NAVY2, transparency: 26 } });\\n  // top tag\\n  s.addShape(pres.shapes.ROUNDED_RECTANGLE, { x: 0.85, y: 0.85, w: 3.1, h: 0.52, fill: { color: ACCENT }, rectRadius: 0.26 });\\n  s.addText(\\\"化工园区 · 数据大屏总览\\\", { x: 0.85, y: 0.85, w: 3.1, h: 0.52, fontFace: FF, fontSize: 12, bold: true, color: NAVY, align: \\\"center\\\", margin: 0, valign: \\\"middle\\\" });\\n  // main title\\n  s.addText([\\n    { text: \\\"化工园区1 \\\", options: { fontSize: 64, bold: true, color: \\\"FFFFFF\\\" } },\\n    { text: \\\"园区总览\\\", options: { fontSize: 64, bold: true, color: ACCENT } }\\n  ], { x: 0.8, y: 1.75, w: 11.7, h: 1.5, fontFace: FF, margin: 0, valign: \\\"middle\\\" });\\n  s.addText(\\\"企业发展 · 产业经济 · 两重点一重大 · 安全生产 · 人才创新\\\", {\\n    x: 0.85, y: 3.45, w: 11, h: 0.5, fontFace: FF, fontSize: 15, color: \\\"C9D8E6\\\", margin: 0\\n  });\\n  // KPI strip\\n  const strip = [\\n    [\\\"16\\\", \\\"入驻企业（家）\\\"],\\n    [\\\"4\\\", \\\"重大危险源企业（家）\\\"],\\n    [\\\"A 级\\\", \\\"园区安全风险等级\\\"],\\n    [\\\"2\\\", \\\"高新技术企业（家）\\\"]\\n  ];\\n  const sw = 2.72, gap = 0.18;\\n  let sx = 0.85;\\n  strip.forEach(function (k) {\\n    s.addShape(pres.shapes.ROUNDED_RECTANGLE, {\\n      x: sx, y: 4.55, w: sw, h: 1.5, fill: { color: NAVY2, transparency: 25 },\\n      line: { color: \\\"2E5A85\\\", width: 1 }, rectRadius: 0.12\\n    });\\n    s.addText(k[0], { x: sx, y: 4.78, w: sw, h: 0.66, fontFace: FF, fontSize: 34, bold: true, color: ACCENT, align: \\\"center\\\", margin: 0 });\\n    s.addText(k[1], { x: sx, y: 5.5, w: sw, h: 0.36, fontFace: FF, fontSize: 11.5, color: \\\"C9D8E6\\\", align: \\\"center\\\", margin: 0 });\\n    sx += sw + gap;\\n  });\\n  s.addText(\\\"数据截至 2026-09-09 · 本报告全部数值取自园区大屏接口返回原始数据\\\", {\\n    x: 0.85, y: 6.75, w: 11, h: 0.35, fontFace: FF, fontSize: 11, color: \\\"8FA8BF\\\", margin: 0\\n  });\\n}\\n\\nconst TOTAL = 9;\\n\\n// ---------- Slide 2 : 园区主体信息 ----------\\n{\\n  const s = pres.addSlide();\\n  bg(s, BG);\\n  header(s, \\\"PARK PROFILE · 园区主体\\\", \\\"园区主体信息\\\");\\n  // left info card\\n  const lx = MX, ly = 1.62, lw = 5.75, lh = 5.42;\\n  card(s, lx, ly, lw, lh);\\n  cardTitle(s, lx, ly, lw, \\\"基本信息\\\");\\n  const rows2 = [\\n    [\\\"园区名称\\\", \\\"化工园区1\\\"],\\n    [\\\"主导产业\\\", \\\"东莞发斯蒂芬、123\\\"],\\n    [\\\"规划面积\\\", \\\"1.78\\\"],\\n    [\\\"建成面积\\\", \\\"1.78\\\"],\\n    [\\\"化工分区规划面积\\\", \\\"1.78\\\"],\\n    [\\\"危化品面积\\\", \\\"8.9\\\"],\\n    [\\\"危化（化工）企业占比\\\", \\\"5\\\"],\\n    [\\\"地理坐标\\\", \\\"东经 113.55492°  北纬 34.82273°\\\"]\\n  ];\\n  let yy = ly + 0.78;\\n  rows2.forEach(function (r) {\\n    s.addText(r[0], { x: lx + 0.25, y: yy + 0.03, w: 2.1, h: 0.4, fontFace: FF, fontSize: 11.5, color: MUTED, margin: 0 });\\n    s.addText(r[1], { x: lx + 2.45, y: yy, w: 3.1, h: 0.46, fontFace: FF, fontSize: 13, bold: true, color: INK, margin: 0, valign: \\\"middle\\\" });\\n    if (r[0] !== \\\"园区名称\\\" && r[0] !== \\\"地理坐标\\\") {\\n      s.addShape(pres.shapes.LINE, { x: lx + 0.25, y: yy + 0.55, w: lw - 0.5, h: 0, line: { color: \\\"EDF1F6\\\", width: 1 } });\\n    }\\n    yy += 0.56;\\n  });\\n  // right side: 4 KPI cards\\n  const rx = lx + lw + 0.3, rw = W - MX - rx;\\n  const cw2 = (rw - 0.2) / 2, ch2 = 1.9;\\n  kpi(s, rx, ly, cw2, ch2, \\\"1.78\\\", \\\"规划面积\\\", STEEL);\\n  kpi(s, rx + cw2 + 0.2, ly, cw2, ch2, \\\"1.78\\\", \\\"建成面积\\\", STEEL);\\n  kpi(s, rx, ly + ch2 + 0.2, cw2, ch2, \\\"8.9\\\", \\\"危化品面积\\\", ACCENT);\\n  kpi(s, rx + cw2 + 0.2, ly + ch2 + 0.2, cw2, ch2, \\\"5\\\", \\\"化工企业占比\\\", ACCENT);\\n  // mini map card\\n  const my0 = ly + 2 * ch2 + 0.4;\\n  const mh = lh - (2 * ch2 + 0.4);\\n  card(s, rx, my0, rw, mh);\\n  cardTitle(s, rx, my0, rw, \\\"园区边界范围示意（经纬度）\\\", STEEL);\\n  // map plot area\\n  const MX0 = rx + 0.45, MY0 = my0 + 0.85, MW = rw - 1.3, MH = mh - 1.1;\\n  const pts = [\\n    [34.82807, 113.55105], [34.82061, 113.55144], [34.81814, 113.54998],\\n    [34.81821, 113.56204], [34.82117, 113.56101], [34.82427, 113.55968],\\n    [34.82635, 113.55771], [34.82744, 113.55500], [34.82800, 113.55299]\\n  ];\\n  const lngMin = 113.549, lngMax = 113.5635, latMin = 34.8175, latMax = 34.8292;\\n  function px(lng) { return MX0 + (lng - lngMin) / (lngMax - lngMin) * MW; }\\n  function py(lat) { return MY0 + (latMax - lat) / (latMax - latMin) * MH; }\\n  const mapped = pts.map(function (p) { return [py(p[0]), px(p[1])]; });\\n  for (let i = 0; i < mapped.length; i++) {\\n    const a = mapped[i], b = mapped[(i + 1) % mapped.length];\\n    s.addShape(pres.shapes.LINE, {\\n      x: Math.min(a[1], b[1]), y: Math.min(a[0], b[0]),\\n      w: Math.abs(b[1] - a[1]), h: Math.abs(b[0] - a[0]),\\n      line: { color: STEEL, width: 1.6 }, flipH: b[1] < a[1], flipV: b[0] < a[0]\\n    });\\n  }\\n  // centroid marker\\n  const cyy = pts.reduce(function (s2, p) { return s2 + p[0]; }, 0) / pts.length;\\n  const cxx = pts.reduce(function (s2, p) { return s2 + p[1]; }, 0) / pts.length;\\n  s.addShape(pres.shapes.OVAL, { x: px(cxx) - 0.07, y: py(cyy) - 0.07, w: 0.14, h: 0.14, fill: { color: ACCENT }, line: { color: CARD, width: 1.5 } });\\n  s.addText(\\\"经度 113.549–113.564  ·  纬度 34.818–34.829\\\", {\\n    x: MX0, y: MY0 + MH + 0.06, w: MW, h: 0.3, fontFace: FF, fontSize: 9, color: MUTED, align: \\\"center\\\", margin: 0\\n  });\\n  footer(s, 2, TOTAL);\\n}\\n\\n// ---------- Slide 3 : 入驻企业与产业发展 ----------\\n{\\n  const s = pres.addSlide();\\n  bg(s, BG);\\n  header(s, \\\"ENTERPRISE · 企业发展\\\", \\\"入驻企业与产业发展\\\");\\n  // KPI row\\n  const chips = [\\n    [\\\"16\\\", \\\"入驻企业（家）\\\"],\\n    [\\\"101\\\", \\\"从业人数（人）\\\"],\\n    [\\\"2\\\", \\\"规上企业（家）\\\"],\\n    [\\\"2\\\", \\\"高新技术企业（家）\\\"],\\n    [\\\"2\\\", \\\"绿色工厂（家）\\\"]\\n  ];\\n  const cwi = (12.23 - 4 * 0.16) / 5;\\n  let cxp = MX;\\n  chips.forEach(function (c) {\\n    kpi(s, cxp, 1.55, cwi, 1.32, c[0], c[1]);\\n    cxp += cwi + 0.16;\\n  });\\n  s.addText(\\\"另有：规下企业 4 家 · 国有企业 1 家 · 创新中心 0 家   （从业人数另一统计口径为 66 人，系统数据不一致）\\\", {\\n    x: MX, y: 2.98, w: 12.23, h: 0.32, fontFace: FF, fontSize: 10, color: MUTED, margin: 0\\n  });\\n  // left: 行业监管分布\\n  const yTop = 3.42, hCard = 3.62;\\n  const lx = MX, lw = 6.05;\\n  card(s, lx, yTop, lw, hCard);\\n  cardTitle(s, lx, yTop, lw, \\\"行业监管分布（家）\\\", STEEL);\\n  hbarRows(s, lx, yTop + 0.75, lw, 2.4, [\\n    { label: \\\"危险化学品监管\\\", value: 8, max: 8, color: ACCENT },\\n    { label: \\\"工贸行业监管\\\", value: 3, max: 8, color: STEEL },\\n    { label: \\\"医药企业监管\\\", value: 0, max: 8 },\\n    { label: \\\"非煤矿山 / 烟花爆竹 / 其他\\\", value: 0, max: 8 }\\n  ], 0.26);\\n  // right: 企业分类 doughnut\\n  const rx = lx + lw + 0.3, rw = W - MX - rx;\\n  card(s, rx, yTop, rw, hCard);\\n  cardTitle(s, rx, yTop, rw, \\\"入驻企业分类（家）\\\", STEEL);\\n  s.addChart(pres.charts.DOUGHNUT, [{\\n    name: \\\"企业分类\\\", labels: [\\\"危化品经营\\\", \\\"危化品生产\\\", \\\"危化品使用\\\", \\\"非危化行业\\\"],\\n    values: [4, 2, 0, 4]\\n  }], {\\n    x: rx + 0.15, y: yTop + 0.55, w: rw - 0.3, h: 2.35,\\n    chartColors: [ACCENT, STEEL, \\\"C9D3DC\\\", GREEN],\\n    holeSize: 58, showLegend: true, legendPos: \\\"b\\\", legendFontSize: 10, legendColor: INK,\\n    showValue: true, dataLabelColor: INK, dataLabelFontSize: 9, dataLabelFontBold: true,\\n    chartArea: { fill: { color: CARD } }, catGridLine: { style: \\\"none\\\" }, valGridLine: { style: \\\"none\\\" }\\n  });\\n  s.addText(\\\"危化相关小计 6 家（经营 4 + 生产 2）；化工行业企业 1 家；「危险化学品监管」口径为 8 家\\\", {\\n    x: rx + 0.25, y: yTop + hCard - 0.85, w: rw - 0.5, h: 0.6, fontFace: FF, fontSize: 9.5, color: MUTED, margin: 0\\n  });\\n  footer(s, 3, TOTAL);\\n}\\n\\n// ---------- Slide 4 : 两重点一重大 ----------\\n{\\n  const s = pres.addSlide();\\n  bg(s, BG);\\n  header(s, \\\"KEY RISKS · 两重点一重大\\\", \\\"两重点一重大统计\\\");\\n  const yTop = 1.6;\\n  const cards4 = [\\n    [\\\"4\\\", \\\"涉及重点监管工艺\\\", \\\"企业（家）\\\", ACCENT, \\\"重点监管的危险化工工艺\\\"],\\n    [\\\"4\\\", \\\"涉及重点监管危化品\\\", \\\"企业（家）\\\", ACCENT, \\\"重点监管的危险化学品\\\"],\\n    [\\\"4\\\", \\\"重大危险源\\\", \\\"企业（家）\\\", RED, \\\"重大危险源企业\\\"]\\n  ];\\n  const cw4 = (12.23 - 2 * 0.3) / 3;\\n  let c4x = MX;\\n  cards4.forEach(function (c) {\\n    card(s, c4x, yTop, cw4, 2.9);\\n    s.addText(String(c[0]), {\\n      x: c4x, y: yTop + 0.55, w: cw4, h: 1.3, fontFace: FF, fontSize: 68, bold: true,\\n      color: c[3], align: \\\"center\\\", margin: 0\\n    });\\n    s.addText(c[1], { x: c4x, y: yTop + 1.95, w: cw4, h: 0.5, fontFace: FF, fontSize: 16, bold: true, color: INK, align: \\\"center\\\", margin: 0 });\\n    s.addText(c[2] + \\\"   ·   \\\" + c[4], { x: c4x + 0.15, y: yTop + 2.42, w: cw4 - 0.3, h: 0.4, fontFace: FF, fontSize: 9.5, color: MUTED, align: \\\"center\\\", margin: 0 });\\n    c4x += cw4 + 0.3;\\n  });\\n  // bottom panels\\n  const yBot = yTop + 3.15, hBot = 2.42;\\n  const lx = MX, lw = 7.3;\\n  card(s, lx, yBot, lw, hBot);\\n  cardTitle(s, lx, yBot, lw, \\\"对比统计\\\", STEEL);\\n  s.addChart(pres.charts.BAR, [{\\n    name: \\\"企业数\\\", labels: [\\\"重点监管工艺\\\", \\\"重点监管危化品\\\", \\\"重大危险源\\\", \\\"涉及危化品(另一口径)\\\"],\\n    values: [4, 4, 4, 5]\\n  }], {\\n    x: lx + 0.2, y: yBot + 0.42, w: lw - 0.4, h: hBot - 0.6, barDir: \\\"col\\\",\\n    chartColors: [ACCENT], chartArea: { fill: { color: CARD } },\\n    catAxisLabelColor: INK, catAxisLabelFontSize: 10, valAxisLabelColor: MUTED, valAxisLabelFontSize: 9,\\n    valGridLine: { color: \\\"E2E8F0\\\", size: 0.5 }, catGridLine: { style: \\\"none\\\" },\\n    showValue: true, dataLabelColor: INK, dataLabelFontSize: 10, dataLabelPosition: \\\"outEnd\\\",\\n    showLegend: false, valAxisMaxVal: 6\\n  });\\n  const rx = lx + lw + 0.3, rw = W - MX - rx;\\n  card(s, rx, yBot, rw, hBot);\\n  cardTitle(s, rx, yBot, rw, \\\"口径说明\\\", STEEL);\\n  s.addText([\\n    { text: \\\"两重点一重大三项统计均为 4 家企业，三类企业高度重合，为本园区安全监管的重点对象。\\\", options: { breakLine: true, paraSpaceAfter: 8 } },\\n    { text: \\\"统计接口另给出「涉及危化品企业」为 5 家；「危险化学品监管」口径企业为 8 家。\\\", options: { breakLine: true, paraSpaceAfter: 8 } },\\n    { text: \\\"重大危险源 / 重点工艺 / 重点危化品明细列表接口因缺少 type 参数暂无法返回，仅展示统计口径。\\\", options: {} }\\n  ], { x: rx + 0.25, y: yBot + 0.68, w: rw - 0.5, h: hBot - 0.9, fontFace: FF, fontSize: 10.5, color: INK, margin: 0, valign: \\\"top\\\" });\\n  footer(s, 4, TOTAL);\\n}\\n\\n// ---------- Slide 5 : 安全管理 ----------\\n{\\n  const s = pres.addSlide();\\n  bg(s, BG);\\n  header(s, \\\"SAFETY · 安全生产\\\", \\\"园区安全管理\\\");\\n  const yTop = 1.55;\\n  // left ring: 风险等级 A\\n  const lx = MX, lw = 3.9, lh = 3.4;\\n  card(s, lx, yTop, lw, lh);\\n  s.addShape(pres.shapes.OVAL, {\\n    x: lx + 0.55, y: yTop + 0.55, w: 2.2, h: 2.2,\\n    fill: { col