6.95 text y0 6.76 ok <7.0. Wait '绿色工厂' first row at 5.25+0.7=5.95? y0 dump earlier? y0 5.95 fine. Value '2 家' etc. Fine, no overlap with right column because right starts at rx=0.55+3.9+0.3=4.75. x up to 4.25 < 4.75 ok.\n\nSlide 6: left note lines y6.42..6.75 with x .8..5.75 within left card (yL = 1.6+1.62=3.22? let me compute yTop=1.6 KPI h1.3, yL = yTop+1.62=3.22, hL = 7.5-0.45-3.22=3.83 → card 3.22..7.05). note placed yL+hL-0.62=3.22+3.83-0.62=6.43 ✓ text two lines to 6.75 < 7.05. Bars rows: 4 rows at yL+0.8=4.02 step .62 → last at ~5.88 ends 6.1, before note ✓.\nRight chart: category labels at y0 6.18..6.35 x7.7..12 ✓ within card (rx=6.55? lx=0.55 lw=5.7 → rx=6.55; rw=13.333-0.55-6.55=6.23 card 6.55..12.78). Bottom note '2026税收22...' at y0 6.61..6.79 x6.8..10.33 within right card ✓. Chart bottom labels y 6.18..6.35 and note top 6.61 → gap ~0.25in ok.\n\nSlide 7: no words below 6.2 aside from footer — cards: left hL=5.45 from 1.6 → 7.05; bars: 6 rows start yTop+1.05=2.65, rowH 0.62 → last ~5.75 end; fine; note card right yN=1.6+2.85=4.45 hN=7.5-0.45-4.45=2.6 → 4.45..7.05; paragraphs to ~6.7? none found below 6.2 besides footer so paragraphs ended ≤6.2 ✓ plenty.\n\nSlide 9: notes list yy increments .9 start yTop+0.78=2.33; 5 rows → last row yy=2.33+4*0.9=5.93; dump shows item5 text at y0 6.0..6.4 within card (1.55..6.97) ✓ and detail text two lines? y0 6.20..6.40 lines wrap to x 11.94 — beyond? x1=11.94 < card right 0.55+12.23-0.4=12.38 ok ✓.\n\nSlide 8 table looks good; note gap fine.\n\nSlide 3 issue confirmed earlier: legend at y0 6.11..6.28 and note text at y0 6.32..6.66 — 0.04in apart → colliding/cramped. Fix: shrink doughnut h to ~1.7 and shift note to y yTop+2.62 (chart y yTop+0.62 h1.75 bottom = 5.79? 3.97+1.75? wait yTop=3.42; chart y = 3.42+0.62=4.04, h1.75 → bottom 5.79; legend ~bottom of chart; note start y=3.42+2.75=6.17 clear of 5.79 by .38; card bottom 3.42+3.62=7.04, note 2 lines to ~6.6 ok. Hmm legend though: doughnut plot maybe legend renders wit